---
manual: styles.stroke
lines: [1453, 1461]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 300, height: 200 do
  strokewidth 4
  @box = rect 50, 50, 100, 80, stroke: red, fill: white
end
----------- test code
r, g, b, = pixel_at(50, 90)
assert(r > 200 && g < 60 && b < 60, "the outline is drawn with the red stroke pen, got #{[r, g, b]}")

r, g, b, = pixel_at(100, 90)
assert(r > 230 && g > 230 && b > 230, "the inside is the fill, not the stroke, got #{[r, g, b]}")
